ical engineering.\n\u2022 Operations and decision science.\n\u2022 Robotics.\n\u2022 Software engineering.\n\u2022 Sustainable engineering and the built environment.\nTempe, Polytechnic\nAviation management and human factors, MSTech\nPolytechnic\nBiological design, MS\nTempe\nBiomedical engineering, MS\nTempe\nChemical engineering, MS\nTempe\nCivil, environmental and sustainable engineering, MS\nTempe\nClean Energy Systems, MS\nPolytechnic\nComputer engineering, MS\nConcentration required. Choose from:\n\u2022 Computer systems.*\n\u2022 Electrical engineering.*\nTempe\nComputer science, MCS\nOptional concentrations:\n\u2022 Big data systems.*\n\u2022 Cybersecurity.*\nOnline\nComputer science, MS\nOptional concentrations:\n\u2022 Big data systems.*\n\u2022 Biomedical informatics.*\n\u2022 Media arts and sciences.*\nTempe\nOnline\nConstruction engineering, MSE\nTempe\nConstruction management and technology, MS\nTempe\nOnline\nData science, analytics and engineering, MS\nConcentration required. Choose from:\n\u2022 Bayesian machine learning.\n\u2022 Computational mathematics and data.\n\u2022 Computing and decision analytics.\n\u2022 Electrical engineering.*\n\u2022 Human centered applications.\n\u2022 Materials science and engineering.\n\u2022 Mechanical and aerospace engineering.\n\u2022 Sustainable engineering and built environment.\nTempe, Polytechnic\nElectrical engineering, MS\nOptional concentrations:\n\u2022 Media arts and sciences.\nTempe\nOnline\nElectrical engineering, MSE\nTempe\nOnline\nEngineering, MEng\nEmphasis required. Choose from:\n\u2022 Engineering management.\n\u2022 Quality, reliability and statistical engineering.\n\u2022 Systems engineering.\nOnline\nEngineering (computing and technology), MEng\nOnline, China (Mandarin language only)\nOnline\nEngineering, MS\nPolytechnic\nEngineering science (software engineering), MSE\nOnline\nEnvironmental and resource management, MS\nOptional concentrations:\n\u2022 Water management.*\nPolytechnic\nEnvironme